}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 0,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- Turn the Dynamic Island on/off with a single toggle.\n- Edit and customize the position of the Dynamic Island.\n- Edit and customize the position of notifications.\n- Hide the Dynamic Island when not in use.\n- Change the size and scale of the Dynamic Island as you like.\n- Adjust the transparency and color of the Dynamic Island.\n\n- **Note:** Before removing the tweak, remember to turn off all features to avoid issues after Respring.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
